NOTE ON DATA / 데이터에 관한 고지

The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository. They do NOT
grant rights over the third-party data redistributed under `data/`:

  data/ets_data.xlsx            KRX Emissions Trading Platform market and
                                auction records; Korean GHG registry /
                                Greenhouse Gas Inventory and Research Center
                                allocation, verified-emissions, carry-over,
                                borrowing and offset records.
  data/K-ETS_마스터데이터.xlsx    Model parameters compiled from published
                                sources; every sheet carries a `source`
                                column naming the origin of each figure.

These files are redistributed for research reproducibility with attribution.
Anyone reusing them should check the terms of the original publisher. See
`data/README.md` for the provenance of each file and `data/MANIFEST.json`
for the fingerprints of the exact versions used to produce the results.

위 MIT 조건은 이 저장소의 **소스 코드**에만 적용된다. `data/` 아래 제3자
자료(KRX 배출권시장 시세·경매, 배출권등록부·온실가스종합정보센터 공개자료)의
권리를 부여하지 않는다. 재현을 위해 출처를 밝혀 재배포하며, 재이용하려는 쪽은
원 공표기관의 이용조건을 확인해야 한다.
